Build configuration in kinet-labs/crypto/ed25519/CMakeLists.txt:
  -DED25519_CUSTOMHASH      => use ed25519-hash-custom.h shim (pulls SHA-512
                               from sha512_minimal.hpp, no OpenSSL).
  -DED25519_CUSTOMRANDOM    => use ed25519-randombytes-custom.h shim (xorshift
                               for batch_verify; deterministic and host-only).
  -DED25519_NO_INLINE_ASM   => skip x86 inline-assembly choose-niels variant
                               (works on Apple Silicon and any non-x86 CPU).
  -DED25519_SUFFIX=_donna   => keep upstream symbols namespaced (_donna suffix)
                               so the C-ABI shim can wrap them without clash.
